(7419536, 1170760, 81362, '<td valign="top">Best candidate for the "real" one is the narrow rectangle just to the right of the garlic clove pictures. Not sure whether iPad and other brands of tablets come with phone capability or not. Good geometry, well executed overlap of images, and pleasing composition making good use of a diagonal cluster of elements.</td>', 'Best candidate for the "real" one is the narrow rectangle just to the right of the garlic clove pictures. Not sure whether iPad and other brands of tablets come with phone capability or not. Good geometry, well executed overlap of images, and pleasing composition making good use of a diagonal cluster of elements.', '2015-11-30 20:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7419537, 1171067, 81362, '<td valign="top">The reflective case on the table top has very sharp corners, so I''ll vote for the screen in a red case in the reflection as being the "real" one. Or does that tablet with possible apple logo just under the black dog have phone capabilities?</td>', 'The reflective case on the table top has very sharp corners, so I''ll vote for the screen in a red case in the reflection as being the "real" one. Or does that tablet with possible apple logo just under the black dog have phone capabilities?', '2015-11-30 20:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7419538, 1170948, 81362, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit I don''t see a cell phone here. But this looks more like a candidate for the November free study than for the Phined the Phone challenge. Perhaps a miss-click when submitting. Nice detail with depth of field choice helping diminish an otherwise busy background.</td>', 'I''ll admit I don''t see a cell phone here. But this looks more like a candidate for the November free study than for the Phined the Phone challenge. Perhaps a miss-click when submitting. Nice detail with depth of field choice helping diminish an otherwise busy background.', '2015-11-30 21:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7419540, 1170733, 81362, '<td valign="top">That light grey thing lower left looks like a TV remote. A more possible candidate is the sliver of black with silver stripe interrupted by a black connector hole lying flat at upper right above the Carol Klein book. More likely you were clever enough to take a picture of the vertical group of pages, display the image on your phone screen, and prop it in front of them lower left next to the stack of books. Good job of matching the lines closely.</td>', 'That light grey thing lower left looks like a TV remote. A more possible candidate is the sliver of black with silver stripe interrupted by a black connector hole lying flat at upper right above the Carol Klein book. More likely you were clever enough to take a picture of the vertical group of pages, display the image on your phone screen, and prop it in front of them lower left next to the stack of books. Good job of matching the lines closely.', '2015-11-30 21:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7419541, 1170964, 81362, '<td valign="top">So you made me go try front and back phone cameras in the mirror to see whether I can get repeating images. Answer is yes, but not nearly as nice as yours, and my finger on the trigger is not limited to the second image in, which means you are slicker at this than me, and perhaps you may have used more than one camera phone. Nicely done.</td>', 'So you made me go try front and back phone cameras in the mirror to see whether I can get repeating images. Answer is yes, but not nearly as nice as yours, and my finger on the trigger is not limited to the second image in, which means you are slicker at this than me, and perhaps you may have used more than one camera phone. Nicely done.', '2015-11-30 21:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
